<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('../../../partials/platform/head.ejs', {
      title: "Smart Career: free stream and career quiz | JobsDoor360",
      description: "Not sure which stream or career to pick? Answer five quick questions and get a direction in about three minutes. Free, no sign-up needed.",
      canonical: "https://jobsdoor360.in/smart-decisions/career/",
    }) -%>
  </head>
  <body class="sd-body" data-ga-module="smart_career">
    <%- include('../../../partials/platform/navbar.ejs', { path: "/smart-decisions/career/" }) -%>
    <main id="main">
      <header class="sd-hero" data-ga-section="hero">
        <div class="sd-wrap">
          <nav class="sd-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-ga-section="breadcrumb"><a href="/" data-ga-event="nav_click" data-ga-name="breadcrumb_home">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/smart-decisions/" data-ga-event="nav_click" data-ga-name="breadcrumb_smart_decisions">Smart Decisions</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page" style="opacity:1;margin:0">Career</span></nav>
          <span class="sd-pill">FREE · ABOUT 3 MINUTES · NO SIGN-UP</span>
          <h1>Which stream or career suits you?</h1>
          <p>Getting time with a counsellor can take weeks. This takes about three minutes. Answer five questions and you'll have a direction to start from.</p>
        </div>
      </header>
      <div class="sd-wrap sd-section">
        <section class="sd-panel" id="sd-quiz-card" data-ga-section="quiz">
          <div class="sd-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span id="sd-progress-bar"></span></div>
          <p class="sd-step" id="sd-step"></p>
          <h2 class="sd-q" id="sd-question" tabindex="-1">Loading…</h2>
          <div class="sd-options" id="sd-options" role="group" aria-labelledby="sd-question"></div>
          <div class="sd-btn-row">
            <button type="button" class="sd-btn sd-btn-ghost" id="sd-prev" style="visibility: hidden" data-ga-name="quiz_back">Back</button>
            <button type="button" class="sd-btn sd-btn-primary" id="sd-next" disabled data-ga-name="quiz_next">Next</button>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="sd-panel sd-hidden" id="sd-result-card" data-ga-section="result" aria-live="polite">
          <div class="sd-result-head">
            <span class="sd-badge">Your free result</span>
            <h2 class="sd-section-title" id="sd-result-title" tabindex="-1">Here's the direction that fits you best</h2>
            <p class="sd-section-sub">A starting point based on your answers, not a final verdict.</p>
          </div>
          <div id="sd-recos"></div>
          <div class="sd-handoff" id="sd-handoff-next" data-ga-section="next_step"></div>
          <div class="sd-upsell" data-ga-section="upsell">
            <h3>Want the full picture?</h3>
            <p>The detailed report covers how well each subject suits you, which entrance exams to aim for, job demand for your options, and a shortlist of colleges.</p>
            <div class="sd-price">₹149 – ₹299</div>
            <a class="sd-btn sd-btn-green" href="/request-received/?for=career_detailed_report" data-ga-event="upsell_click" data-ga-name="career_detailed_report_cta" data-ga-product="career_detailed_report" data-ga-price="149-299">Get the detailed report</a>
            <small>One-time payment. No waiting for a counsellor.</small>
          </div>
          <div class="sd-handoff" data-ga-section="next_step">Rather talk it through with a person? <a href="/career-counselling/" data-ga-name="career_to_counselling">See career counselling →</a><br>Ready to build skills? <a href="/pricing/" data-ga-name="career_to_courses">Browse our courses →</a></div>
          <%# Sign-in prompt switched OFF: results pages no longer send people to
              the login page. To bring it back, move the block below out of this
              comment and uncomment the matching lines in the page's script.js.

          <div class="sd-handoff sd-hidden" id="sd-signin-hint" data-ga-section="signup_prompt">
            Want to keep this result and get suggestions that match it?
            <a id="sd-signin-link" href="/login/" data-ga-event="signup_prompt_click" data-ga-name="career_signup_prompt">Create a free profile →</a>
          </div>
          -%>
          <div class="sd-btn-row" style="justify-content: center">
            <button type="button" class="sd-btn sd-btn-ghost" id="sd-restart" data-ga-name="quiz_retake">Retake the quiz</button>
            <a class="sd-btn sd-btn-primary" href="/smart-decisions/" data-ga-name="see_all_smart_decisions">See all Smart Decisions</a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>
    <%- include('../../../partials/platform/footer.ejs') -%>
    <script type="module" src="/staticfiles/db/dbconfig.js"></script>
    <script type="module" src="/staticfiles/mainfiles/smart-decisions/career/script.js?v=<%= platform_version %>"></script>
  </body>
</html>
